<div xmlns:perseus="http://www.perseus.org/meta/perseus.rdfs#" xmlns:dctype="http://purl.org/dc/dcmitype/" xmlns:tufts="http://www.tufts.edu/" xmlns:alph="http://alpheios.net/namespaces/tei" class="alpheios-lex-text_container en">
    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n55982" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">κατίσχω</span></b> , collat. form of <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">κατέχω</span>, <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>hold
				back</i>, <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">οὐδὲ κατίσχει
			[ἵππους</span>] <i><span class="en">
				Il.
				23.321
			</span></i>; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">τὰς νέας</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Hdt.
					2.115
				</span></i>
			; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">θυμοῦ μένος ὀξὺ κατισχέμεν</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					<u>h.Hom.</u>
					8.14
				</span></i>
			:—
				Med.
			, <i>keep by one</i>, 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">γυναῖκα νέην . . , ἥν τ᾽ αὐτὸς . .
					κατίσχεαι</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Il.
					2.233
				</span></i>
			. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense2"><b>II.</b>
			<i>possess, occupy</i>, 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">οὐ ποίμνῃσιν καταΐσχεται</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Od.
					9.122
				</span></i>
			, <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἀράχνια κ. ὅλον τὸ σμῆνος</span>
			<i>cover</i> it, <i><span class="en">
				Arist.
				<u>HA</u>
				626b18
			</span></i>. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense2"><b>III.</b>
			
				=
				<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">κατέχω</span>
			
			<i><span class="en">
				A.
			</span></i> IV, 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἐς πατρίδα γαιαν νῆα κατισχέμεναι</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Od.
					11.456
				</span></i>
			, cf. <i><span class="en">
				Hdt.
				8.41
			</span></i>; <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἐνὶ Φάσιδι νῆα</span>
			<i>put in</i> there, <i><span class="en">
				A.R.
				3.57
			</span></i>. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense2"><b>IV.</b> intr.,
				<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">σέλας κατίσχει ἐξ οὐρανοῦ ἐπὶ τὴν
				βοῦν</span> the light <i>comes down</i> from heaven, <i><span class="en">
				Hdt.
				3.28
			</span></i>. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense3"><b>2.</b> of ships,
				<i>put in</i>, <i><span class="en">
				Th.
				7.33
			</span></i>.</div>
